  "id": "open-face-mozzarella-sandwich",
  "name": "Open-Face Mozzarella Sandwich",
  "subtitle": "Tomato, basil, and mozzarella on toasted Italian bread",
  "description": "An open-faced sandwich layered with ripe tomato, fresh basil, and mozzarella, finished with olive oil and balsamic vinegar.",
